OL,3,GNEWSAPlans submitted to expand
OL,4,Atechnical college
OL,5,
OL,6,FA technical college in Hull is planning
OL,7,Fto expand its campus with a new sixth
OL,8,Fform centre and additional classrooms.
OL,10,FRon Dearing University Technical
OL,11,FCollege has submitted plans to convert
OL,12,Foffice space in The Maltings, on
OL,13,FSilvester Street in the city centre.
OL,15,FThe additional premises would function
OL,16,Fas an extension to the existing campus
OL,17,Fin Kingston Square.
OL,19,FThe college offers employer-led
OL,20,Feducation for children aged 14-18 and
OL,21,Fspecialises in digital, engineering and
OL,22,Fart and design.
